     1	"""AppKit specialized mutation tools (P4 / TOOL-1).
     2	
     3	Small, SEMANTIC edits to an app's structured AppSpec (`.disco/appspec.json`), each
     4	re-rendering a self-contained `index.html`. The model edits the spec — not raw HTML —
     5	so a copy/color/section change touches exactly one thing (the targeted-edit law). A raw
     6	file rewrite is NOT in this set; it lives only in the repair/custom contract scopes.
     7	
     8	Tools: app_create / app_update_content / app_add_section / app_remove_section /
     9	app_reorder_section / app_set_design / app_set_tweak / app_snapshot_version.
    10	"""
